  "description": "RF-Networks Protocol Parser Framework — parses OldProtocol (Mesh), RFM, and GPRS protocol frames. Features a Template Method parser base, Chain of Responsibility handler chains, Strategy-pattern frame decoders, and logging/filtering decorator wrappers.",
